    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Detached bungalow residence on a private site in Gorey’s premier residential address.\r\n\r\n‘Wilmslow’ is situated in one of the most prestigious areas of Gorey known as ‘The Avenue’.  It is a tree lined street, mostly residential, leading from Main Street to the Wexford Road and the M11.  Everything is within easy walking distance, with the town’s Main Street, the train station, Gorey Shopping Centre and Tesco’s all within 500 metres.\r\n\r\nThe house itself has not been occupied for many years and is now in need of significant renovation. While the original property is reasonably sound, the extensions to the rear are derelict and will need to be demolished. It will qualify for all the relevant grants and is just waiting for someone with a little imagination to bring it into the 21st century."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Porch\t\t2.6m x 2.3m\t\t\r\nEntrance Hall\t\t4m x 1.2m\r\nLiving room\t\t\t4m x 3.5m\r\nFeature fireplace, hot press. Sliding doors to patio area.\r\nKitchen/breakfast room\t3.3m x 2.1m\r\nRange of wall & floor units. Plumbed for washing machine etc.\r\nSitting room\t\t\t3.8m x 3.8m\r\nFeature fireplace.\r\nDining room\t\t\t3.8m x 2.8m\t\r\nSliding doors to rear garden.\r\nBedroom 1\t \t\t3.8m x 3m\r\nBedroom 2\t\t\t3.8m x 2.7m\r\nBedroom 3\t\t\t3.9m x 2.7m\r\nBathroom\t\t\t\r\nShower room\t\t\r\nBack Lobby"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tAll mains \r\n•\tc. 0.129 acres\r\n•\tGenerous parking areas to front"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
